CORE
case-generate3.sv
--bound 0
^\[main\.p1\] always main\.out == 255: PROVED up to bound 0$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A case generate construct outside of a generate region used to fail the
invariant "unexpected module item: verilog_case_generate". The module sub
is instantiated only in the case generate construct, and is hence not a
top-level module.
